      "widgets_values": [
        "Create a concise training caption for this image.\n\nRules:\n- Always begin with: <trigger-word>\n- Describe only visible, changeable details.\n- Include clothing, pose, expression, camera angle, framing, lighting, background, and notable objects.\n- Do not describe the person’s fixed facial identity, facial structure, attractiveness, ethnicity, age, or body type unless it is essential and visibly variable.\n- Do not use names.\n- Do not invent details.\n- Keep the caption natural and compact, ideally one sentence.\n- Do not mention image quality, resolution, watermark, or filename.\n\nOutput only the caption.\n\nExample:\n<trigger-wrod>, wearing a black coat, standing outdoors at night, looking at the camera, three-quarter view, soft street lighting, blurred city background"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Create a concise training caption for this image.\n\nRules:\n- Always begin with: <trigger-word>\n- Describe only visible, changeable details.\n- Include clothing, pose, expression, camera angle, framing, lighting, background, and notable objects.\n- Do not describe the person’s fixed facial identity, facial structure, attractiveness, ethnicity, age, or body type unless it is essential and visibly variable.\n- Do not use names.\n- Do not invent details.\n- Keep the caption natural and compact, ideally one sentence.\n- Do not mention image quality, resolution, watermark, or filename.\n\nOutput only the caption.\n\nExample:\n<trigger-wrod>, wearing a black coat, standing outdoors at night, looking at the camera, three-quarter view, soft street lighting, blurred city background"
